# Line-ending policy: LF in the repository and in working trees everywhere, except
# Windows-native scripts. This overrides each developer's core.autocrlf setting, so
# Windows development and Linux CI see byte-identical files (matches .editorconfig).
* text=auto
*.java text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
mvnw text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary files must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
